      <p class="s-col-body">Buy enough for three to four dinners. Portion into approximately 6–7 oz servings. Salmon is ideal — it cooks incredibly fast and is loaded with protein and healthy fats.</p>
      <p class="s-col-body">Marinate in the Lemon Garlic Marinade (next page). Place portions in a Ziploc bag, remove as much air as possible, refrigerate.</p>

