      <h3 class="s-col-title">Under Al Dente</h3>
      <p class="s-col-body">Cook gluten-free pasta or ziti slightly under al dente. Drain. Toss lightly with olive oil to prevent sticking. Refrigerate. It finishes cooking when you reheat it in the pan.</p>
